<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>I. Y. Khan</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0d1117;
      --card-bg: #161b22;
      --border: #30363d;
      --text: #e6edf3;
      --text-muted: #8b949e;
      --accent: #58a6ff;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      max-width: 520px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }
    h1 { font-size: 1.85rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    p.subtitle { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    p.bio { color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }
    .btn {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text);
      background: transparent;
    }
    .btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); background: rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.05); }
    footer { margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>I. Y. Khan</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Writer &bull; Engineering &bull; Tech</p>
    <p class="bio">
      Welcome to my personal home base. I write fiction and speculative work alongside engineering and technology pursuits. More project updates and writing archives coming soon.
    </p>
    <div class="links">
      <a href="mailto:contact@iykhan.com" class="btn">Get in Touch (Email)</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME" class="btn" target="_blank">GitHub Profile</a>
    </div>
    <footer>&copy; 2026 I. Y. Khan. All rights reserved.</footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
